"x": "Stack: Java 21, Spring Boot WebFlux, Actuator, Validation, Security, Spring Cloud Circuit Breaker with Resilience4j, Micrometer, Prometheus, OpenTelemetry OTLP, OpenShift Route, probes, ServiceMonitor, Jenkins CI/CD."
